{"data":{"body":"[P2] Add the required example for the changed session API\n\nRoot `AGENTS.md` Tests rule 3 requires an example for a public API change. This PR updates only extension-local tests using `FakeAgentcoreClient`; the existing AgentCore example exercises `agentcore()`, so it does not demonstrate or validate the revised session configuration. Add a minimal `agentcoreSession` example with its integration test, omitting the session timeout while retaining per-job timeouts.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABFoCkuw","finding_digest":"785f3a4fc0bea915fa561402b64ec1d6ea4733eb7bbd1c0ea19e84106c5470d7","finding_id":"arf_v1_pbptut6ax2url6swcqblmtwb23","finding_key":"extensions/agentcore::agentcoresession::public-api-example-coverage","identity_key":"extensions/agentcore::agentcoresession::public-api-example-coverage","line":88,"observation_digest":"76247fd775703de917490be36475c2afb7e6b829cc170564527ffe1009db906b","observation_id":"aro_v1_oysh7v3voa66sf2jbprwi5ocv6","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-extensions/src/compute/agentcore/session.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-11-23T21:50:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_7ipcg4u7fh7ogv4ybhuiolqq7r","reviewed_base_sha":"33c92063528091160c2dc43d2b80bcb601d049b8","reviewed_head_sha":"6cb6aa20804611a9204ef0371039e101bff19b94","reviewer":"codex","start_line":88,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1279},"record_id":"art_v1_3lzkvhv4ritasxkj665krljquy","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-23T21:50:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
